+PQMC/CP bridge patch series
+Base: official CPMC-Lab 2.0, CPMC_Lab_20160129
+Mixed initial/guide determinants, fixed-horizon paths, and genealogy
+diagnostics are implemented in CPMC_Bridge.m without changing stock calls.
